   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UTS Responsible Mining Southeast Asia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UTS Responsible Mining Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this assignment is to support Sida in the development of a structured and scalable capacity development programme on responsible mining in Indonesia and the Philippines, aligned with Sidas priorities on governance, environmental and social sustainability, and inclusive economic development, and to propose a coordinated framework for Team Sweden engagaemnt in the sector - A Roadmap for Team Sweden engagement in responsible mining in Southeast Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie, som ska st&#xf6;dja Sida och andra Team Sweden-akt&#xf6;rer att identifiera skalbara insatser f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka ansvarsfull gruvdrift i Indonesien och Filippinerna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide a scoping study to support Sida and other Team Sweden actors, in developing a structured and scalable approach to support responsible mining in Indonesia and the Philippines.</narrative>
  </description>
